<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#141312">
  <meta name="description" content="Cinnabar Mod is the official HUD and module pack for Cinnabar: 39 modules, a drag-and-drop HUD editor, profiles and waypoints.">
  <title>Cinnabar Mod</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="@@FAVICON@@">
  <link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/schibsted-grotesk-latin-700-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
  <style>
    @@SITE_HEADER_STYLES@@
    :root { --cinnabar-red: @@RED@@; --solid-at: 320px; color-scheme: dark; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { background: var(--ground); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    body { margin: 0; overflow-x: clip; background: var(--ground); color: var(--ink); font: 400 17px/1.6 var(--sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    p, h1, h2, h3, figure { margin: 0; }
    a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 4px; }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
    .wrap { width: min(100% - 2 * var(--gutter), var(--page)); margin-inline: auto; }

    .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr); gap: 32px 48px; align-items: end; padding-top: calc(var(--site-header-height) + 56px); }
    h1 { font: 700 clamp(3.25rem, 8.6vw, 6rem)/.98 var(--sans); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .hero-side { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .description { font: 500 clamp(21px, 1.9vw, 26px)/1.28 var(--sans); letter-spacing: -.015em; text-wrap: pretty; }
    .edition { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--soft); font: 400 16px/1.5 var(--sans); }
    .download { margin-top: 28px; }
    .download-note { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0 .4em; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--soft); font: 400 15px/1.5 var(--sans); }
    .download-note a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration-color: #ffffff59; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; transition: text-decoration-color .15s ease-out; }
    .download-note a:hover { text-decoration-color: currentColor; }
    code { font: 400 .92em/1.5 var(--mono); }

    /* The menu capture runs edge to edge and fades into the page at top and bottom. */
    .showcase { position: relative; margin-top: 8px; }
    .showcase .shot { display: block; overflow: clip; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: none; mask: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0000 0, #000 7%, #000 94%, #0000 100%); }
    .showcase .shot:hover { border: 0; box-shadow: none; transform: none; }
    .showcase img { width: 100%; }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      @supports (animation-timeline: scroll()) {
        .showcase img { animation: menu-settle linear both; animation-timeline: scroll(root); animation-range: 0 80svh; }
      }
    }
    @keyframes menu-settle { from { transform: scale(1.035); } to { transform: none; } }
    .showcase figcaption { margin-top: 8px; padding-inline: var(--gutter); color: var(--soft); font: 400 15px/1.5 var(--sans); text-align: center; }
    .shot { display: block; overflow: clip; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raise); cursor: zoom-in; transition: border-color .2s ease-out, transform .2s cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1), box-shadow .2s ease-out; }
    .shot:hover { border-color: var(--line-strong); box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -28px #000; transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .shot:active { transform: translateY(0); box-shadow: none; }
    .shot:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 12px; }
    .showcase .shot:focus-visible { outline-offset: -6px; border-radius: 0; }
    .pair figcaption { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--soft); font: 400 15px/1.5 var(--sans); }

    section { padding-top: 128px; }
    h2 { font: 700 clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 60px)/1.04 var(--sans); letter-spacing: -.032em; text-wrap: balance; }
    .lead { color: var(--soft); font: 400 clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 20px)/1.5 var(--sans); text-wrap: pretty; }
    .lead a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration-color: #ffffff59; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; transition: text-decoration-color .15s ease-out; }
    .lead a:hover { text-decoration-color: currentColor; }

    .catalog-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr); gap: 16px 48px; align-items: end; }
    .catalog { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 48px 32px; margin-top: 64px; }
    .catalog h3 { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong); font: 700 22px/1.2 var(--sans); letter-spacing: -.015em; }
    .catalog h3 data { color: var(--quiet); font: 400 14px/1 var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .catalog ul { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; color: var(--soft); font: 400 16px/1.4 var(--sans); }
    .catalog li { padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); break-inside: avoid; }
    .hud { grid-column: span 2; }
    .hud ul { columns: 2; column-gap: 32px; }

    .layout-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr); gap: 16px 48px; align-items: end; }
    .pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-top: 56px; }
    .facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px 32px; margin: 64px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .facts li { padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); color: var(--soft); font: 400 16px/1.55 var(--sans); }
    .facts strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--ink); font: 700 20px/1.3 var(--sans); letter-spacing: -.012em; }
    .keys { white-space: nowrap; }
    kbd { display: inline-block; padding: 0 7px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 5px; background: var(--raise-2); box-shadow: inset 0 -1px #0006; color: var(--ink); font: 500 .84em/1.6 var(--mono); white-space: nowrap; }

    .install h2 { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin: 56px 0 0; padding: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--raise); list-style: none; counter-reset: step; }
    .steps li { counter-increment: step; padding: 32px; }
    .steps li + li { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .steps li::before { content: counter(step); display: block; margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--ink); font: 700 56px/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: -.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .steps h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; font: 700 22px/1.25 var(--sans); letter-spacing: -.015em; }
    .steps p { color: var(--soft); font: 400 16px/1.55 var(--sans); text-wrap: pretty; }
    .steps strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
    .help { margin-top: 24px; color: var(--soft); font: 400 16px/1.6 var(--sans); }
    .help a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration-color: #ffffff59; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; transition: text-decoration-color .15s ease-out; }
    .help a:hover { text-decoration-color: currentColor; }

    footer { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 8px 32px; align-items: end; margin-top: 128px; padding-block: 32px 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--quiet); font: 400 14px/1.5 var(--sans); }
    .foot-logo { grid-column: 1 / -1; width: min(100%, 300px); margin: -8px 0 0 -12px; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero, .catalog-head, .layout-head { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
      .hero { padding-top: calc(var(--site-header-height) + 40px); }
      section { padding-top: 80px; }
      .catalog { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin-top: 40px; }
      .hud { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
      .pair { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 32px; margin-top: 40px; }
      .facts { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); margin-top: 40px; }
      .steps { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); margin-top: 40px; }
      .steps li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px minmax(0, 1fr); padding: 24px; }
      .steps li + li { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .steps li::before { grid-row: span 2; margin: 0; font-size: 40px; }
      footer { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); margin-top: 80px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .showcase img { width: 128%; max-width: none; margin-left: -14%; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .download { width: 100%; padding-inline: 16px; font-size: 17px; }
      .catalog { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
      .hud ul { column-gap: 16px; }
      .visual ul, .mechanic ul { columns: 2; column-gap: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="site">
  @@SITE_HEADER@@
  <main>
    <div class="hero wrap">
      <h1>Cinnabar <span>Mod</span></h1>
      <div class="hero-side">
        <p class="description">Your HUD, your keybinds, your setup. The official module pack for Cinnabar.</p>
        <p class="edition">Free WASM mod for Minecraft Bedrock · Requires Cinnabar</p>
        <a class="download" href="@@API_ORIGIN@@/v1/mod/download"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2h4v7h4l-6 6-6-6h4zM3 15h3v2h8v-2h3v5H3z"/></svg>Download Cinnabar Mod</a>
        <p class="download-note">Downloads <code>CinnabarClient.wasm</code> · <a href="#install">How to install</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="showcase">
      <a class="shot" href="/mod/mods.webp" aria-label="Open the full-size Mods menu screenshot"><img src="/mod/mods.webp" alt="In game, the Mods menu of Cinnabar Mod over a blurred world: a grid of module cards with live previews, toggles and shortcut buttons, filters for HUD, Visual and Mechanic modules, and a search field." width="1532" height="862"></a>
      <figcaption>The Mods menu. Search, filter, toggle and bind every module from one grid.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="modules wrap" aria-labelledby="modules-title">
      <div class="catalog-head">
        <h2 id="modules-title">39 modules, ready to switch on</h2>
        <p class="lead">PvP essentials and everyday info. Every module has its own settings and an optional shortcut.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="catalog">
        <div class="hud"><h3>HUD <data value="22">22</data></h3><ul><li>FPS</li><li>CPS</li><li>Keystrokes</li><li>Armor Status</li><li>Coordinates</li><li>Potion Effects</li><li>Ping</li><li>Direction HUD</li><li>Saturation</li><li>Scoreboard</li><li>Reach Display</li><li>Momentum</li><li>Playtime</li><li>Stopwatch</li><li>Item Counter</li><li>Inventory</li><li>View Angles</li><li>Potion Counter</li><li>Totem Counter</li><li>Speed Meter</li><li>Clock</li><li>Day Counter</li></ul></div>
        <div class="visual"><h3>Visual <data value="10">10</data></h3><ul><li>Crosshair</li><li>Lighting</li><li>Menu Blur</li><li>Time Changer</li><li>Hit Color</li><li>Nametags</li><li>Hitbox</li><li>Damage Indicator</li><li>Hurt Cam</li><li>Weather Changer</li></ul></div>
        <div class="mechanic"><h3>Mechanic <data value="7">7</data></h3><ul><li>Zoom</li><li>Toggle Sneak/Sprint</li><li>CPS Limiter</li><li>Inventory Cursor</li><li>No Swing Sounds</li><li>No Cam Reset</li><li>No Item Delay</li></ul></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="layout wrap" aria-labelledby="layout-title">
      <div class="layout-head">
        <h2 id="layout-title">Tune it, then put it where you want it</h2>
        <p class="lead">Open any module for its settings and a live sample: color, background, opacity, scale and more. Press <kbd>Right Shift</kbd> in game to open HUD Layout, then drag and resize widgets on a snapping grid.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pair">
        <figure>
          <a class="shot" href="/mod/settings.webp" aria-label="Open the full-size Keystrokes settings screenshot"><img src="/mod/settings.webp" alt="In game, the Keystrokes settings drawer beside the module grid: an enable switch, a shortcut button, a sample with an Edit position button, and controls for text color, background, background opacity, scale and text shadow." width="1532" height="862" loading="lazy"></a>
          <figcaption>Every module has its own settings and a live sample.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <a class="shot" href="/mod/layout.webp" aria-label="Open the full-size HUD Layout screenshot"><img src="/mod/layout.webp" alt="In game, HUD Layout over the world: FPS, CPS, Keystrokes and Armor Status widgets on a snapping grid, with a Modules button in the center." width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy"></a>
          <figcaption>HUD Layout: drag widgets anywhere on screen.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li><strong>Profiles</strong>Keep separate modules, shortcuts and layouts for each way you play, and switch between them anytime.</li>
        <li><strong>Waypoints</strong>Save places per world so they only show up where they belong.</li>
        <li><strong>Saved as you go</strong>Every edit saves automatically. Undo with <span class="keys"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd> <kbd>Z</kbd></span>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="install wrap" id="install" aria-labelledby="install-title">
      <h2 id="install-title">Install in three steps</h2>
      <p class="lead">You need an up-to-date copy of <a href="/">Cinnabar</a> first.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><h3>Download</h3><p>Save <strong>CinnabarClient.wasm</strong> with the button at the top of this page.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Import</h3><p>In Cinnabar, open <strong>Settings → Mods → Import</strong>, pick the file and grant the capabilities it asks for.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Play</h3><p>Join a world and press <kbd>Right Shift</kbd>. Choose <strong>Modules</strong> to start switching things on.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="help">Stuck? <a href="https://discord.gg/MeEz7BEHcM">Ask in Discord</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="wrap"><img class="foot-logo" src="/title.png" alt="" width="2000" height="667" loading="lazy"><p>Cinnabar Mod · The official HUD and module pack for Cinnabar.</p><p>Not affiliated with Mojang or Microsoft.</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
